{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1550275200, "end_date": 1550966399, "month_true_total": 267, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:19:19 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49197273", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051672684", "personaname": "Ironbreaker's Song", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bedgravity/", "num_games_owned": 362, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 13020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3764, "last_played": 1769719336, "avatar": "68d1099f62e9c4f8a00ccabcd1a9cf23f9853027"}, "language": "english", "review": "A really fun co-op with tight mechanics and a lovely community. The developers listen to the community and the game just keeps getting better with each patch. A gem of a game!\n\nAnd also, BEARDS and HATS!", "timestamp_created": 1550959221, "timestamp_updated": 1550959393, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49194947", "author": {"steamid": "76561198224179184", "personaname": "Creeps", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CreepoBeepoId/", "num_games_owned": 79, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 41463, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12246, "last_played": 1778271202, "avatar": "22a2ecb4e32fe8b9b0c50e5c42cd3013830424e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "gOLD\n", "timestamp_created": 1550950563, "timestamp_updated": 1589299536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49191028", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011687806", "personaname": "Liquidhalo231", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Liquidhalo231/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 44918, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3483, "last_played": 1754751681, "avatar": "83a385953d703a798c1227cc70eb4f77240d15b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "So, a friend of mine actually bought me this game to play with him and, hoo boy am I thankful. \nAs such, I will be checking the box that says I received this game for free, however, I've not been paid nor have I received a copy of the game in return for giving this review.\n\nDeep Rock Galactic is a lot of fun and is most fun when played with a group of friends. However, you can just join a random game with random players. The game rewards having more players in a session, giving bonuses and such and giving every player 100% of the resource pool at the end of the mission. As an example, if your team collects 100 of a resource, you each will get 100, not 25 like most other games do.\n\nI very much appreciate that this game has no microtransactions, instead using the ingame currency and ores (both are things that you get from missions) to buy upgrades, cosmetics and beers (beers can buff you or just make you drunk, your choice!)\n\nNothing is handed to you in this game and everything is worked for in a way that makes it fun and not a grind, since every mission is different due to the map generation system it keeps the game fun to keep coming back to.\n\nThis is being written on February of 2019 while the game is still early access and I have to say, it is one of the most polished early access games I've ever seen.\n\nI voted this game for the labour of love award because it really is!", "timestamp_created": 1550938977, "timestamp_updated": 1574801583, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.574700117111206055", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49182802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003824895", "personaname": "Six", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003824895/", "num_games_owned": 248, "num_reviews": 135, "playtime_forever": 428, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 169, "last_played": 1713118761, "avatar": "be0ab841135ad9ed60a5f9617ac216b190551f5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Noice, feels like a long term Alien Swarm", "timestamp_created": 1550919157, "timestamp_updated": 1550919207, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49168136", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145534128", "personaname": "Cadunkus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145534128/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 21600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1574, "last_played": 1762042227, "avatar": "925342ac0be5e7b9654f8a6ae5c085ed275b0da6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Whoever is in charge of parking the drop pod, they need to fire him.", "timestamp_created": 1550896688, "timestamp_updated": 1550896688, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_stea